File: doc/form-components.md

OLD_SECTION
- "Module prerequisites" told consumers to import ListScroller and FormValidator
  themselves and attach them to window as a workaround for the missing imports.
- Caveat markers "(see Known issues)" on datePicker daysToolTip, file fileToolTip,
  slideSwitch.refresh() and file.refreshFile().
- Slide switch label attribute documented as required whenever showLabel is true.
- select config table had no optionGroupStyle row (the property threw before the fix).
- A "Known issues (4.0.0-beta)" section enumerating all verified defects with line
  references.

NEW_SECTION
- "Module prerequisites" now states both modules are imported by vUX-formComponents.js
  itself (noting the extra module load as the only consequence).
- Caveat markers removed; slideSwitch.refresh()/file.refreshFile() documented as
  working; fileToolTip documented without the "leave this on" warning.
- Slide switch label attribute documented as defaulting to "On,Off" when absent.
- optionGroupStyle row added to the select config table.
- "Known issues" replaced by "Remaining limitations (4.0.0-beta)": one visual size per
  select className (generated stylesheet is per-class), the slide-switch
  checkbox-last-child markup constraint, and the file label showing only the first
  selected file.

REASON
The documented defects were fixed in vUX-formComponents.js (see the module's change log
in this feature); the guide now describes the fixed behavior and keeps only the
limitations that genuinely remain.
